From 36f7aa63070e2e10ebca385b94d258ca3b5fcfe8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nassos Yiannopoulos <nassosyian@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 23:56:19 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 43/54] hw/display/pvg: guest fixup for Tahoe x86 Metal nil
 targetDeviceArchitecture abort

AppleParavirtGPUMetal.bundle (x86 plugin) does not implement
targetDeviceArchitecture; loading any MTLBinaryArchive aborts in
+[MTLLoader sliceIDForDevice:...] so iconservicesagent, Spotlight and Dock
extras crash-loop (blank icons). A background thread finds the assertion's
.cold.1 function in guest RAM and makes it return (slice 0, RenderBox compiles
shaders from source). Property guest-fixups (default on).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 hw/display/meson.build            |   4 +-
 hw/display/pvg-linux-pci.c        |   9 ++
 hw/display/pvg/pvg-guest-fixups.c | 220 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 hw/display/pvg/pvg-guest-fixups.h |  17 +++
 4 files changed, 248 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 hw/display/pvg/pvg-guest-fixups.c
 create mode 100644 hw/display/pvg/pvg-guest-fixups.h

